            "review_title": "Review at DC's Pizza",
            "review_text": "beckie m\nLiverpool, United Kingdom39 contributions\n0\nAwesome pizza\nApr 2018 • Couples\nCame today with my boyfriend and loved it! 200k for an unlimited pizza buffet and a delicious salad bar. The inside was super clean and the chef was american, so it was easy to communicate that we were vegetarian. There was an amazing selection of pizzas and he also custom made some pizzas for us, to take out the meat- such as the Philly cheeseburger pizza and a loaded potato pizza. \nThe service was super friendly and all the pizza tasted great! Having lived in Vietnam for a few months, we both agreed this was the best pizza we have had so far! \nWas like a real taste of home and we will for sure be coming back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 20, 2018",
